      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Imboden%2C_Arkansas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Imboden sits on the south side of the Spring River, a tributary of the Black River.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
