      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Imboden%2C_Arkansas"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Sloan-Hendrix School in Imboden began in 1899 as a private academy linked to Hendrix College before becoming public.",
